# Copy this file to .env (not required — the app uses OAuth token files directly)
# Place your downloaded OAuth credentials file as:  credentials.json
# The app will create token.json automatically on first run via browser login.
#
# Steps to get credentials.json:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create/select a project → APIs & Services → Enable "Google Drive API"
# 3. APIs & Services → Credentials → Create Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 4. Application type: Desktop App
# 5. Download the JSON file and rename it to  credentials.json
# 6. Place credentials.json in this project directory
